# Primary User Journey

User enters:

"Reliance Industries"

or

"Should I buy Reliance?"

Athena automatically:

1. Fetches market data
2. Fetches company fundamentals
3. Fetches latest news
4. Calculates technical indicators
5. Creates research context
6. Generates AI analysis
7. Displays actionable insights

Research time:

Traditional:
30–60 minutes

Athena:
30–60 seconds

